Source: dccp
Section: kernel
Maintainer: Thomas Dreibholz <dreibh@simula.no>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, dkms
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Homepage: https://github.com/dreibh/dccp

Package: dccp-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 2.1.0.0)
Description: DCCP kernel modules (DKMS)
 This package provides the Datagram Congestion Controlled Protocol (DCCP)
 kernel modules (dccp, dccp_ipv4, dccp_ipv6, dccp_diag) for Linux kernels
 >= 6.19. The modules are built via DKMS.
